WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.634
- I remember seeing Vince

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:04.971
as a young kid.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.240
And I tell this story during every interview, but

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.476
I was in the stands as a young kid,

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:10.610
he’s my favorite player,

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.412
wearing the full purple and gold,

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:13.680
the shoes and everything,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.314
full everything.

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:16.616
- You were Vinced out
- Vinced out! Headband.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:17.817
I didn’t even need- I didn't like wearing headbands

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.252
but I wore it just cuz of Vince,

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.655
and I yelled his name as-

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:26.659
as um, as hard as I could.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.529
And I was like,
“Vince Carter! Vince Carter!”

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.664
and I could tell, like,

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.666
he's in the game,
like he's in the game and

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.237
he's got this kid out of nowhere just heckling at him.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.472
And I'm just sitting there so excited, I’m asking,

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.840
“Can I yell his name?”

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:44.177
And he looked up and he went like this

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.879
and I'll never forget about that.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:46.913
I remember the story.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:47.680
I remember the day,
- Just the gesture.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.816
- just going like, just going like that.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:54.721
So when I see a kid
or I see a fan,

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:55.422
even adults.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:57.023
It’s kind of weird with adults, cuz

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.691
it’s like, you should understand, like, just give me-

00:00:58.691 --> 00:00:59.692
- Yeah.
- You know, just take a-

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.295
Just chill. But-
- Yeah, chill out. We’re grown.

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:04.764
- But when I see a kid, at least, um

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.700
with that kind of excitement, like, I don’t-

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.568
I just drop everything.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.036
You know, I don't have to

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.471
carry that with me when I see a kid

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:13.506
so happy.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.208
Cuz that moment changed my life.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:18.211
That moment changed my outlook, my

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:20.947
perception on people,
all that stuff.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.782
So just by when I was six years old,

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.117
I remember that, that changed me.

